## Explicit additional environments

The owner authorized separate environments on this same hostname on 2026-09-08.
Use `deploy/create-environment.py` for an explicitly selected new environment.
Read `docs/workspaces-prd.md` before provisioning or updating one.
Keep the existing service, route, accounts, and data intact.
An ordinary master release still updates only `multiimageclient-ui.service`.
Additional environments require explicit target selection and independent resource budgets.

## Global administration contract (2026-09-09)

Use exactly two account levels: admin and normal. The existing ernieMultiZone account is the sole global admin.
Preserve its existing password when enabling the environment controller.
Preserve the original private route and all stored work.
Additional environments can use owner-selected public URL names; never treat the original private route as public.
Enforce membership and feature switches on API requests, not only in the frontend.
Normal members may see shared environment activity, but never raw application logs or global administration.
Install the privileged reconciler as root-owned code outside application-writable directories.
